   "content": "**The US and UK are the largest destinations for students studying abroad.** The leading hosts in 2023 were:\n\n| Destination | International students |\n|---|---:|\n| US | 957,000 |\n| UK | 748,000 |\n| Australia | 467,000 |\n| Germany | 423,000 |\n| Canada | 389,000 |\n\nRussia, Turkey and France came next. These figures count international students in higher education.\n\nThe map uses each destination’s latest report from **2021–2023**; countries without recent data are left blank. Source: UIS, February 2026 release.",
